  "summary": {
    "text": "Dream path dao marks are law traces of dream path. Dense marks in a Pure Dream Reality Seeker Physique body put entering souls to sleep and strip memories; they also let that physique enter dream realms, and they nurture dream path materials when they dominate an aperture.",
