  "claims": [
    {
      "text": "In a Pure Dream Reality Seeker Physique body the dream path dao marks are very high in quantity and gain a power of their own. Any soul that enters falls asleep and loses memories continuously.",
      "chapters": [
        1001
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "intro",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "sys_pure_dream_reality_seeker_physique"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "General dao marks and attainment levels are covered on dao marks and attainment.",
      "chapters": [],
      "certainty": "inferred",
      "confidence": "C",
      "verification": "no_citation",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "intro",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "sys_dao_marks"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Old Man Yan Shi’s Pure Dream Reality Seeker Physique can live only eighteen hours. Even after the sleeping-soul weakness is removed, dream path dao marks still make the soul lose memories, so dumping information into the mind fails as the more that is forced in, the faster it is forgotten.",
      "chapters": [
        1002
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "eighteen-hour-physique-limit",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "char_old_man_yan_shi"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "When Fang Yuan processes dream path immortal materials with a metal path cutting method, some of the dream path dao marks are consumed. He notes that other processing methods might preserve more of those marks.",
      "chapters": [
        1293
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "consumed-in-refinement-cutting",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "char_fang_yuan"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Pure Dream Reality Seeker Physique bodies have dream path dao marks yet still cannot stay inside dream realms indefinitely; when time is up they must come out.",
      "chapters": [
        1373
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "dream-realm-time-limit",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
    },
    {
      "text": "The Pure Dream Reality Seeker Physique contains dream path dao marks and was meant as an eleventh extreme physique, but once its time limit ends it detonates into a dream realm. Its advantage is that the body can enter and exit dream realms with the soul protected.",
      "chapters": [
        1419
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "physique-detonation-flaw",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
    },
    {
      "text": "Because of the dream path dao marks on a Pure Dream Reality Seeker Physique body, Ying Wu Xie can use lead soul into dream and affect rank eight Gu Immortal Jun Shen Guang.",
      "chapters": [
        1631
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "affects-a-rank-eight-foe",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "char_ying_wu_xie",
        "sys_gu_immortal",
        "char_jun_shen_guang"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Crazed Demon Cave holds all kinds of dao marks, including dream path dao marks. Those marks alone are not a dream realm, and to Fang Yuan’s sovereign immortal body they are harmless like other path marks there.",
      "chapters": [
        1865
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "cave-marks-and-aperture-growth",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "loc_crazed_demon_cave"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Dream path Gu materials suppressed by surrounding earth path marks grow poorly in the wild, but in Meng Zhen immortal aperture, where the environment is predominantly dream path dao marks, those materials can grow freely.",
      "chapters": [
        2097
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "cave-marks-and-aperture-growth",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
